  "verificationScope": "# Original Linear4.2: actual finite-free SHEAF Ext vanishing and SAME Hom cokernel\n\nLET X be ANY actual scheme,N an actual O_X-module sheaf,and q>=0.\nCONSTRUCT actual O_X-linear Hom(O_X,N)~=N by evaluation at1 on every\noriginal open. PROVE restriction compatibility and coefficient naturality.\nUsing native injective resolution and cohomology,PROVE\n SHEAF Ext^(q+1)(O_X,N)=0.\nPROVE actual contravariant SHEAF Ext source functor additive;reuse native\nfinite products and actual native freeCofan to PROVE\n SHEAF Ext^(q+1)(free(iota),N)=0 for EVERY finite actual type iota.\nFor a GENUINE actual finite-free frame e:P~=free(iota),DERIVE the same\nvanishing for P. No desired vanishing is an input to these theorems.\nThis is derived INTERNAL SHEAF Ext,NOT GLOBAL Ext. No claim that globally\nlocally free module sheaves are globally projective.\n\nLET S be SAME actual short exact sequence0->A-f->B-g->C->0.\nIF SHEAF Ext^(q+1)(B,N)=0,PROVE SAME actual native-snake boundary\n delta_I^q:Ext^q(A,N)->Ext^(q+1)(C,N)\nepi and a UNIVERSAL cokernel of SAME source map f^*. CONSTRUCT actual\ncokernel(f^*)~=Ext^(q+1)(C,N),PROVE projection followed by iso is SAME\ndelta_I,and PROVE independence of ANY actual coefficient resolution I.\nA genuine finite-free middle frame DERIVES the needed vanishing.\nPROVE source naturality of the actual Ext^0~=Hom comparison,including\nits inverse map. Thus for q=0 CONSTRUCT\n coker[Hom(B,N)->Hom(A,N)] ~= SHEAF Ext^1(C,N)\nwith SAME normalized connecting map and resolution independence.\nThe Hom precomposition is ACTUAL original f,not an arbitrary map or\nan isomorphic unnamed class. The finite-free middle specialization has\nNO higher-Ext vanishing input.\n\n34exact declarations=20theorems+14object constructions;9roots518physical\nlines,7split imported audits. All34full types,14construction bodies,\nroles and standard axiom closures read before freeze.42closed project\nmodules,33nonroot bytes match PUBLIC29/PUBLIC65 frozen arc